step	1	-	Quick guide step 1
line	<col=000080>Speak to <col=800000>Denulth</col> directly South of the Burthorpe Teleport.</col>
step	2	-	Quick guide step 2
line	<str>Speak to Denulth directly South of the Burthorpe Teleport.</str>
line	
line	<col=000080>Follow the path to the stronghold. You can buy the climbing boots along the way from <col=800000>Tenzing</col>. (Note: If you have completed The <col=800000>Easy Combat Achievements</col> you can skip this section, including the fight with Dad, by teleporting with <col=800000>Ghommal's hilt 1</col>)</col>
step	3	-	Quick guide step 3
line	<str>Speak to Denulth directly South of the Burthorpe Teleport.</str>
line	
line	<str>Follow the path to the stronghold. You can buy the climbing boots along the way from Tenzing. (Note: If you have completed The Easy Combat Achievements you can skip this section, including the fight with Dad, by teleporting with Ghommal's hilt 1)</str>
line	
line	<col=000080>Enter the arena and attempt to kill <col=800000>Dad</col>. The fight will end before Dad is killed (can be safespotted from the gate; magic or a halberd are good choices due to his high range defence).</col>
step	4	-	Quick guide step 4
line	<str>Speak to Denulth directly South of the Burthorpe Teleport.</str>
