line	
line	<str>Enter the arena and attempt to kill Dad. The fight will end before Dad is killed (can be safespotted from the gate; magic or a halberd are good choices due to his high range defence).</str>
line	
line	<col=000080>After nearly killing Dad exit the arena through the north gate.</col>
