line	<col=000080>Follow the red path to <col=800000>Troll General</col>. Kill one and loot the <col=800000>prison key</col>. (Can be safespotted with a halberd, magic, or a ranged weapon behind the counter) (Hardcore Ironmen beware! The general is aggressive and his max hit is 38)</col>
